# NexaTech Partner Program

## Program Tiers

### Silver Partner
- Requirements: 2 certified consultants, $100K annual revenue
- Benefits: 15% discount, co-marketing support, partner portal access

### Gold Partner
- Requirements: 5 certified consultants, $500K annual revenue
- Benefits: 20% discount, dedicated partner manager, MDF funding

### Platinum Partner
- Requirements: 10 certified consultants, $1M annual revenue
- Benefits: 25% discount, executive sponsor, priority support

## Partner Types

**Resellers**
- Sell NexaTech licenses to end customers
- Commission: 20% of first-year revenue

**System Integrators**
- Provide implementation and consulting services
- Referral fee: 15% of first-year revenue

**Technology Partners**
- Build integrations with NexaTech platform
- Co-marketing opportunities

## Enablement
- Partner certification program
- Sales and technical training
- Demo environment access
- Marketing collateral

